    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if talking to anyone will even help. they all moved on without me. like, they have their lives and i'm just this leftover piece of nothing that nobody wants. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen to make it real, because right now i don't even feel like a person. i just feel like a void.",
